#: ninefruits/security/actions/mfa.py
msgid "Two-factor authentication is required for your account and cannot be disabled."
msgstr "तपाईंको खाताका लागि दुई-चरण प्रमाणीकरण अनिवार्य छ र असक्षम गर्न सकिँदैन।"

