# key: security.sso.not_linked
#: ninefruits/security/views_sso.py
#, python-format
msgid "Your %(provider)s account is not linked to an account here. Sign in with your password and link it under Security."
msgstr "तपाईंको %(provider)s खाता यहाँको कुनै खातासँग जोडिएको छैन। पासवर्डले साइन इन गरी सुरक्षा पृष्ठमा जोड्नुहोस्।"

